Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||01-24-2001||04:29 PM||||The server is doing fine and is nowhere near it's performance limit.<P>However, for me the forum - or any other website on the same subnet - seems slow too. I think there is a problem with a router somewhere because all sites on this subnet show 25% packet-loss. I have already contacted the appropriate people and they are looking in to it. It could still be something completely different though, and it is not sure there's anything wrong at all... But I would like to hear from others how their speed is.<BR>||||reg||1
