Z||000003||Cliff Pennock||01-24-2001||06:07 PM||||Ray, that's typically an AOL problem. AOL uses proxies and when someone on your subnet has just viewed the mainpage of the forum, AOL will serve this page from its proxy instead of fetching it from my server.||||reg||1
