Z||000010||LarryB||01-24-2001||10:12 PM||||When you consider that this server is hosted in the Netherlands and a lot, if not most, of us are in the US, the performance is remarkably and consistently good, which speaks well of Cliff and his hosting provider. <P>2 potential bottlenecks up front: Quest's leased capacity on the transatlantic cables and the capacity at their peering points in the US.<P>||||reg||1
